     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "特写：摆着杯子和装饰品的餐桌。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ec/f0/ecf0a6a51026de8f097368dc575a11c1.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ec/f0/ecf0a6a51026de8f097368dc575a11c1.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>选择一个主题并围绕其展开活动</strong><br />这算得上是餐桌布置的高级主题了。我们选择了一个芭蕾舞的主题，不过你可以从今年最喜爱的书、电影或是歌曲里寻找灵感！</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "冷冽的玻璃效果餐厅中装饰着一个雪球灯罩，铺着一块巨大的地毯。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f8/bc/f8bcc5dbef2b28159c20102386cb4c7e.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f8/bc/f8bcc5dbef2b28159c20102386cb4c7e.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "特写：玻璃烛台里闪着柔和光芒的蜡烛，一旁是玻璃材质的餐具。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/21/ed/21ed78604b66d39a50ba304981472ee9.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/21/ed/21ed78604b66d39a50ba304981472ee9.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>使用单一色彩</strong><br />布置这个餐桌时，我们以玻璃材质为基础，然后逐渐延伸。如果你想让餐桌呈现出一种色彩，可以试着通过不同的材质和色调为桌面增加些层次感。在餐桌上摆放相同颜色的蜡烛，能为空间有效增添温暖亲切之感。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "以节日为主题布置的餐桌下是一块柔软的大地毯，沐浴在交织的温暖灯光下。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/67/18/6718e66b18f9950415aab2ddc8309cd7.jpg"
