     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "木质椅子摆在柔软的地毯上，一旁以节日为主题的餐桌上摆放着蜡烛。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/89/6d/896d41e2c47f34c9205fa5338d9a3234.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/89/6d/896d41e2c47f34c9205fa5338d9a3234.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>尽享舒适</strong><br />用餐结束以后，坐在餐桌旁聊天到深夜，这是一种多么美妙的感觉？在这个餐桌的布置上，我们利用天然材料营造温馨的氛围。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "装饰品从树枝上垂下来，下面是一张以节日为主题的餐桌，布置灵感源自大自然。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b6/70/b670a121a48e79f9fa6049378f564db5.jpg"
